flowchart TD
  %% DefySwarm Cloud Storage Security Console — Screen Flow & Information Architecture

  Entry([Console Entry]) --> Sync[Control Plane Sync\nGET /api/state + WS /ws/live]
  Sync --> Overview

  %% Global Shell & Utility Overlays
  subgraph Shell [Persistent Console Shell]
    direction TB
    Sidebar[Left Sidebar — 5 Domains\nOverview · Storage · Threat Ops · Validation · Settings]
    Topbar[Top Bar — 48px\nBreadcrumb · Bucket Context · Role Switcher]
    CmdK[Quick Search / Command Palette ⌘K]
    ConnectAI[Connect AI Button\nShown only when AI key not configured]
  end

  subgraph Modals [Shared Overlays & Drawers]
    direction TB
    Onboarding[OnboardingModal\nInitial AI Analysis & Posture Setup]
    Forensic[ForensicDrawer\nEvent Payload, Entropy & AI Triage]
    RestoreModal[1-Click Vault Restore Modal\nClean WORM Snapshot Preview & Apply]
    ConfirmModal[ConfirmSheet\nDestructive Action Guard]
  end

  ConnectAI -->|Opens| Onboarding
  CmdK -.->|Jump to Workspace / Sub-tab| Sidebar
  CmdK -.->|Trigger Attack Drill| Telemetry
  CmdK -.->|Inspect Recent Incident| Incidents

  %% 1. Overview Workspace
  subgraph W1 [1. Overview Workspace]
    direction TB
    Overview[OverviewView\nTopology Diagram · Live Metrics · Recent Activity]
    OverviewActions[Contextual Header Actions\nAuto-Harden · Edit Policy]
  end

  %% 2. Storage Workspace
  subgraph W2 [2. Storage Workspace]
    direction TB
    LiveFiles[Sub-tab: Live Files\nLiveStorageView — Upload, Browse, Download, Delete]
    CanariesVault[Sub-tab: Canaries & Vault\nCanariesVaultView — Honeypot Files & WORM Snapshots]
    LiveFiles <-->|Workspace Sub-tab| CanariesVault
  end

  %% 3. Threat Ops Workspace
  subgraph W3 [3. Threat Ops Workspace]
    direction TB
    Telemetry[Sub-tab: Live Telemetry\nWarRoomView — Real-Time Event Stream & Signal Matrix]
    Incidents[Sub-tab: Incidents\nIncidentsView — Contained Threats & Recovery Queue]
    Telemetry <-->|Workspace Sub-tab| Incidents
  end

  %% 4. Validation Workspace
  subgraph W4 [4. Validation Workspace]
    direction TB
    Simulator[Sub-tab: Simulator\nSimulatorView — Controlled Attack Drills & Validation]
    Analytics[Sub-tab: Analytics\nAnalyticsView — Detection KPIs, Latency & Trends]
    Simulator <-->|Workspace Sub-tab| Analytics
  end

  %% 5. Settings Workspace
  subgraph W5 [5. Settings Workspace]
    direction TB
    Config[Sub-tab: Configuration\nSetupView — Policy YAML, S3 Connectors, AI & Alerts]
    HealthAudit[Sub-tab: Health & Audit\nHealthView — System Health, Quotas & Audit Trail]
    Config <-->|Workspace Sub-tab| HealthAudit
  end

  %% Primary Domain Navigation (Single Source of Truth)
  Sidebar -->|Overview| Overview
  Sidebar -->|Storage| LiveFiles
  Sidebar -->|Threat Ops + Open Badge| Telemetry
  Sidebar -->|Validation| Simulator
  Sidebar -->|Settings| Config

  %% Contextual Cross-Screen Journeys
  Overview -->|Edit Policy| Config
  Overview -->|Buckets / Upload / Live Files| LiveFiles
  Overview -->|Canaries / Vault Binding| CanariesVault
  Overview -->|AI / Alerts / Webhook Config| Config
  Overview -->|View Analytics| Analytics
  Overview -->|Open Live Telemetry| Telemetry
  Overview -->|View Incidents / Select Incident| Incidents
  Overview -->|Run Validation Drill| Simulator

  LiveFiles -->|Configure Storage Connector| Config
  CanariesVault -->|Configure AI / Vault Policy| Config

  Telemetry -->|Inspect Event| Forensic
  Telemetry -->|View Contained Incidents| Incidents
  Telemetry -->|Launch Drill| Simulator

  Forensic -->|Open Incident Queue| Incidents
  Forensic -->|Inspect Vault Snapshots| CanariesVault

  Incidents -->|Restore Clean Snapshot| RestoreModal
  Incidents -->|Re-run Validation Drill| Simulator
  Incidents -->|Revoke / Confirm Action| ConfirmModal

  Simulator -->|Monitor Live Response| Telemetry
  Simulator -->|Review Triggered Incidents| Incidents

  Onboarding -->|Complete Setup| Overview
  Onboarding -->|Configure Storage| Config
